      "created_at": "2014-12-11T03:08:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'll do Pydro's list first, perhaps i'll reveal some fun deaths another time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: I'll also note if a promo makes a difference or not. Because obviously I will kill Golem Unity a lot faster than I would kill regular Unity! While Dark Watch Mister Fixer is less likely to be incapped than regular Mister Fixer.</p>",
