    {
      "id": 122782,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-11T03:37:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They are not in any special order in the list, it's just the order they came into my head. Humorously, the two examples of heroes that alter the chance of survival I gave earlier were the only two that does so.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><b>Heroes That Will Probably be Incapped or At Least Below 5 HP</b></p><p>Absolute Zero, Fanatic, Setback, The Visionary, Tempest, Ra, KNYFE, Golem Unity, and Chrono-Ranger.</p><p><strong>Heroes That Will Most Likely End Below 10 HP</strong></p><p>Bunker, Legacy, Mister Fixer, The Argent Adept, Tachyon</p><p><strong>Heroes That Will Possibily Be Between 10 and 20 HP</strong></p><p>Dark Watch Mister Fixer, Haka, The Wraith, The Scholar, Unity, The Naturalist, Parse,&nbsp;<span>Expatriette</span></p><p><strong>Heroes That End With 20+ HP</strong></p><p>NightMist, The Sentinels (adding their HP together), Omnitron-X</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bonus!</p><p><strong>Heroes That Will Probably Incap Other Heroes Before Dealing the Killing Blow to the Villain</strong></p><p>Tachyon, Unity, Bunker, The Visionary, NightMist, Chrono-Ranger, Setback, Haka</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:56:34.382Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 1,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.2,
