      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>They are not in any special order in the list, it&#39;s just the order they came into my head. Humorously, the two examples of heroes that alter the chance of survival I gave earlier were the only two that does so.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><b><u>Heroes That Will Probably be Incapped or At Least Below 5 HP</u></b></p><p>Absolute Zero, Fanatic, Setback, The Visionary, Tempest, Ra, KNYFE, Golem Unity, and Chrono-Ranger.</p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 12.7272720336914px;\"><u>Heroes That Will Most Likely End Below 10 HP</u></strong></p><p>Bunker, Legacy, Mister Fixer, The Argent Adept, Tachyon</p><p><u style=\"font-size: 12.7272720336914px;\"><strong>Heroes That Will Possibily Be Between 10 and 20 HP</strong></u></p><p>Dark Watch Mister Fixer, Haka, The Wraith, The Scholar, Unity, The Naturalist, Parse,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12.7272720336914px; line-height: 20px;\">Expatriette</span></p><p><strong><u>Heroes That End With 20+ HP</u></strong></p><p>NightMist, The Sentinels (adding their HP together), Omnitron-X</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bonus!</p><p><strong><u>Heroes That Will Probably Incap Other Heroes Before Dealing the Killing Blow to the Villain</u></strong></p><p>Tachyon, Unity, Bunker, The Visionary, NightMist, Chrono-Ranger, Setback, Haka</p>",
